# Skill UI metadata inventory

- REQ-01: Register the 30 existing UI metadata files with current SHA-256 hashes,
  retaining original copy revisions and archives as historical provenance.
- REQ-02: The checker must accept that revision and reject missing, altered,
  duplicate or incorrectly bound records. Other preservation gates remain active.
- AC-01 → REQ-01: The new revision covers all 30 metadata files, hashes match observed bytes, and prior revisions are unchanged.
- AC-02 → REQ-02: Focused mutation tests reject corruption, deletion, duplicate records, incorrect predecessors and unrelated additions.

The profile discrepancy for commit-governance, UI rendering, skill effectiveness
and application behavior are outside scope. Global governance may remain rejected.
